# D4/D12 regression — signed-int column-vs-column WHERE in a CTE body is now
# cleanly + PERMANENTLY rejected (was: retryable error / hang).
#
# Findings D4 + D12 (cte_test_driven_findings.md) / fix-plan H3.  A col-vs-col
# predicate in a CTE-body WHERE used to misbehave two ways depending on whether
# the left column is indexed:
#   D4a/D12 (orders, o_custkey < o_orderkey): o_custkey is indexed, so the
#       conjunct was mis-classified as an index bound and encode_constant()
#       failed on the column RHS, thrown as the RETRYABLE RonSQLMaybeStaleSchema
#       -> RDRS retried it 10x before giving up (hang-like).
#   D4b/D4 (lineitem, l_quantity < l_partkey): l_quantity is not indexed, so the
#       body took the TABLE_SCAN path and emitted an NdbScanFilter attr-vs-attr
#       program that HUNG the data node.
# Both compare two SIGNED INT columns.  RonSQL now rejects col-vs-col in a
# CTE-body WHERE up front with a clean RonSQLPermanentError (RPE) in
# build_cte_scopes (check_no_cte_body_col_vs_col), so neither retries nor hangs.
# Supporting col-vs-col in a CTE-body filter is tracked for a later phase.
#
# This is a rejection-assert regression (prepare-time error -> no data touched),
# run via $RONSQL_CLI_EXE with --error 1, mirroring body_index.inc /
# body_chain_scalar.inc.  --record to refresh r/ when the message changes.

--source include/have_ndb.inc

--disable_warnings
call mtr.add_suppression("Schema dist coordinator detected timeout");
call mtr.add_suppression("Participant timeout");
--enable_warnings

--source suite/ronsql_cte/include/cte_schema.inc
--source suite/ronsql_cte/include/cte_data.inc

--echo
--echo === D4a/D12: CTE-body col-vs-col on orders (o_custkey < o_orderkey, indexed left) — permanent rejection ===
--error 1
--exec $RONSQL_CLI_EXE --connect-string $NDB_CONNECTSTRING -D test -e 'WITH sums AS (SELECT o_custkey AS k, COUNT(*) AS n, SUM(o_shippriority) AS t FROM orders WHERE o_custkey < o_orderkey GROUP BY o_custkey) SELECT sums.k, SUM(sums.n), SUM(sums.t) FROM customer AS c JOIN sums ON sums.k = c.c_custkey GROUP BY sums.k;' 2>&1

--echo
--echo === D4b/D4: CTE-body col-vs-col on lineitem (l_quantity < l_partkey, non-indexed left) — permanent rejection ===
--error 1
--exec $RONSQL_CLI_EXE --connect-string $NDB_CONNECTSTRING -D test -e 'WITH liq AS (SELECT l_orderkey AS k, COUNT(*) AS n, SUM(l_quantity) AS q FROM lineitem WHERE l_quantity < l_partkey GROUP BY l_orderkey) SELECT o.o_custkey, SUM(liq.n), SUM(liq.q) FROM orders AS o JOIN liq ON liq.k = o.o_orderkey GROUP BY o.o_custkey;' 2>&1

--source suite/ronsql_cte/include/cte_drop.inc
